<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 570.31, down 2.26.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 336 to 192.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.06.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,368,760, compared with 19,720,615 Monday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
